    "detailed_description": "Mahjong on the background of the rising sun! Soft and delicate morning colors, the city and the countryside in a bluish haze, glistening dew drops on the leaves of trees..... All this and fascinating levels-puzzles in the mahjong genre are waiting for you in this game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will find more than 100 mahjong game layouts! Starting from simple and classic to exquisite themed ones. Go through 6 game locations, each of which is full of amazing puzzles. Multi-layered levels and huge layouts of 200 chips! This is what you have been looking for a long time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Collect gold chips to complete levels and open the next location<br />\r\n- Capture bonus chips and get extra coins and bonuses<br />\r\n- combo multiplier to increase coins<br />\r\n- 6 locations<br />\r\n- 120 levels<br />\r\n- 2 game difficulty modes",
